    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UntitledShooterGame</strong>\u00a0incorporates standard 5v5 like gameplay as well as various modes such as Deathmatch, Defusal, and Prop Hunt. USG uses Peer-To-Peer multiplayer which essentially means there are no dedicated servers, and instead the host of the game is the server, which means it will provide low ping if all players are in the same region. It is recommended to play this game with your friends for the best experience, or alternatively you can play with the AI bots. Join the discord to stay up to date with updates such as new maps, weapons, DLC and more. (Gameplay snapshots coming to store soon)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UntitledShooterGame</strong>\u00a0incorporates standard 5v5 like gameplay as well as various modes such as Deathmatch, Defusal, and Prop Hunt. USG uses Peer-To-Peer multiplayer which essentially means there are no dedicated servers, and instead the host of the game is the server, which means it will provide low ping if all players are in the same region. It is recommended to play this game with your friends for the best experience, or alternatively you can play with the AI bots. Join the discord to stay up to date with updates such as new maps, weapons, DLC and more. (Gameplay snapshots coming to store soon)</p>",
